# Context

Per-domain narrative loaded on demand

- [Agent](agent/index.md): What an agent runs against the board, being the CLI, the checks, and capture
- [Board](board/index.md): The browser app, split into the shell, commands, agent work, the inspector, the hand actions, and the server
- [Content](content/index.md): What lives on disk, being the board folder model, themes, and tokens
- [Development](development/index.md): Contributor workflow, being the local toolchain, scripts, hooks, and CI
